flowchart TD
    Action[Staff starts an operation] --> Command[Admin BFF mutation]
    Command --> Guard{Authorized and within tenant scope?}
    Guard -- no --> Error[Structured error state]
    Guard -- yes --> Persist[Persist command or durable intent]
    Persist --> Immediate[Return accepted/success response]
    Immediate --> UI[Dashboard updates optimistic or pending state]
    Persist --> Queue[Queue or provider boundary]
    Queue --> Worker[Tenant-stamped worker]
    Worker --> Retry{Retryable failure?}
    Retry -- yes --> Queue
    Retry -- no --> Result[Persist terminal result and evidence]
    Result --> Notify[Notification or socket event]
    Notify --> Ticket[Verified socket ticket and tenant room]
    Ticket --> UI
    Retry -- no --> Failed[Visible failure and remediation path]
    Failed --> UI
    UI --> Refresh[Re-fetch authoritative state]
    Refresh --> API[Admin read API]
    API --> DB[(Tenant database)]

    Note1[Async completion is not assumed from the initial HTTP response.] -.-> Immediate
    Note2[Realtime delivery is tenant-scoped and must be followed by an authoritative read.] -.-> Notify